\f12\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {The information security officer will protect our information assets in all forms from unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or interruption\emdash that is, ensure their confidentiality, 
integrity, and availability. This job includes protection of all patient-identifiable information in paper, oral, and electronic forms.
\par 
\par Areas of responsibility include: information security policies and procedures; security risk assessment and management;
 oversight of security of the network, servers, and workstations including portables, as well as their physical security; disaster-recovery planning; and information security awareness and training.
\par 
\par }\pard\plain \s16\ql \li360\ri1080\sl-360\slmult0\widctlpar\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\faauto\adjustright\rin1080\lin360\itap0 
